TY  - JOUR
TI  - Modelling the Economic Impact of Next Generation Sequencing and Precision Medicine on Childhood Cancer Management—a Microsimulation Approach
AU  - Tan, Owen
AU  - Schofield, Deborah J
AU  - O’Brien, Tracey
AU  - Trahair, Toby
AU  - Shrestha, Rupendra N
VL  - 14
